Ozё␀ЏЛWY,¬w{—Ѕ…FT (File Transfer) - Remote File Transfer v1.00
Transfer files from Remote FT Server

Usage: ft -g [filename]  or  ft -gb [filename]

Options:
  -g  <filename>  Get a text file (normalize line endings)
  -gb <filename>  Get a binary file (verbatim bytes)
  Omit filename to enter the remote name with its exact case.
  Set HTTP_BASE_URL in ENV to the remote server URL.
  Example: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AzureSphereCloudEnabledAltair8800/RetroGames/refs/heads/main/

Examples:
  ft -g test.txt       Download text file from server
  ft -gb prog.com      Download binary file from server
$Downloading '$' from Remote FT Server...
$Saving as '$'
$Error: Failed to create output file '$'
$Done ($ bytes)
$Failed - file not found or server error
$Missing HTTP_BASE_URL in ENV.
Run ENV, choose A to add or its number to edit.
